  "stem": "A body moving with a uniform acceleration has velocities of u and v when passing through points A and B in its path. The velocity of the body midway between A and B is?",
  "answer": {
    "text": "$\\sqrt{\\frac{u^{2} + v^{2}}{2}}$"
  },
